        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35017001",
          "sourceType": 10,
          "text": "龙骧麟振",
          "title": "小节引文",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35017002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "你们快看，米菲亚做好了一只金光闪闪的超级大喵~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35017003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "这是猫？似乎哪里不对。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35017004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这不是猫咪啦，米菲亚，这个叫作金麒麟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35017005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "优纪会知道这个，有些意外呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35017006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是「兔儿爷」告诉我的，她知道好多有趣的民俗知识呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35017007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "难得你们会对民俗感兴趣。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35017008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不会不会，民俗真的很有趣，难怪主人也那么入迷。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35017009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "|101||103|会对民俗感兴趣，真是个浪漫的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35017010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "诶？！绯野为什么突然要把「兔儿爷」拉走？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35017011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "这还不明白吗，当然是恶补民俗学的知识——立刻，马上。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35017012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "在了解|101||103|这件事上，绝不允许有人能够超越我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
